{"id":"wb-7-1106","name":"大胜塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大胜塔","text":"大胜塔位于中国江西省九江市浔阳区能仁寺内，故又称能仁寺塔，1957年被列为江西省文物保护单位，2013年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。\n大胜塔是楼阁式砖塔，平面呈六边形，内为空筒，高42.38米。塔底西向为正门，东北面阑额之上另辟一门，作为登塔入口，二层以上采用上下斜向穿壁绕平座的登塔方式。其登塔方式与赣州慈云寺塔、石城宝福院塔、信丰大圣寺塔相似，故大胜塔的建造年代应不早于宋，又据明嘉靖《九江府志》记载，明洪武及永乐年间曾大规模重修。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E8%83%9C%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86555374,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86555374","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c41343d2bb9eb6eb950abdc8.jpg","title":"九江能仁禅寺大胜塔.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B9%9D%E6%B1%9F%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%81%E7%A6%85%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E8%83%9C%E5%A1%94.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/%E4%B9%9D%E6%B1%9F%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%81%E7%A6%85%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E8%83%9C%E5%A1%94.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Gisling","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"​九江能仁禅寺大胜塔","width":320,"height":452}}